---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Home" description="Max Weiner — Customer Success Leader, CS & AI Strategist, and Coach based in Washington, DC.">

  <div class="mw-hero">
    <h1 class="mw-hero-headline">Max Weiner<em>Customer Success Leader <span class="mw-sep">·</span> CS &amp; AI Strategist <span class="mw-sep">·</span> Coach</em></h1>
  </div>


  <div class="work-section">
    <div class="eyebrow">The Work</div>
    <h2 class="work-headline">Ten years of<br><em>making customers stick.</em></h2>
    <p class="work-bio">
      10+ years managing enterprise portfolios up to $18M ARR across SaaS and PaaS - growing Fortune 10 accounts, cutting churn with prediction models, and building the playbooks and health programs that help CS teams scale.
    </p>

    <div class="cards-label">Career Highlights</div>

    <!-- Featured card -->
    <div class="card card-featured">
      <div class="card-image">
        <svg class="motif" viewBox="0 0 400 220" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
          <line x1="46" y1="184" x2="360" y2="184" stroke="#1A3A6B" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.18"/>
          <rect x="70"  y="150" width="34" height="34"  fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.12"/>
          <rect x="132" y="120" width="34" height="64"  fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.16"/>
          <rect x="194" y="92"  width="34" height="92"  fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.20"/>
          <rect x="256" y="60"  width="34" height="124" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.26"/>
          <rect x="318" y="30"  width="34" height="154" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.34"/>
          <polyline points="87,150 149,120 211,92 273,60 335,30" fill="none" stroke="#1A3A6B" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          <path d="M335 30 l-14 3 M335 30 l3 14" fill="none" stroke="#1A3A6B" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <div class="impact-label">Business Impact</div>
        <div class="impact">$1.6M → $5.5M ARR</div>
        <div class="card-rule"></div>
        <div class="field-label">Context</div>
        <p class="field-text">Inherited a strained Fortune 10 account with complaints on billing transparency, support, and time to value, spanning many disconnected teams with no executive alignment.</p>
        <div class="field-label">Role</div>
        <p class="field-text">Rebuilt trust over 8 months through a new operating cadence, EBRs, a custom billing module, and success planning, unlocking $3.9M in expansion ARR.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cards">

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-image">
          <svg class="motif" viewBox="0 0 400 220" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M40 150 C 120 150, 150 70, 250 62 S 360 58, 360 56" fill="none" stroke="#1A3A6B" stroke-width="2.5" opacity="0.7"/>
            <circle cx="86" cy="150" r="4.5" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.5"/>
            <circle cx="128" cy="120" r="4.5" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.5"/>
            <circle cx="176" cy="96" r="4.5" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.5"/>
            <circle cx="232" cy="72" r="4.5" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.5"/>
            <circle cx="300" cy="60" r="4.5" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.5"/>
            <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="3.5" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.2"/>
            <circle cx="210" cy="118" r="3.5" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.2"/>
            <circle cx="278" cy="98" r="3.5" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="impact-label">Business Impact</div>
          <div class="impact">87% Churn Prediction Accuracy</div>
          <div class="card-rule"></div>
          <div class="field-label">Context</div>
          <p class="field-text">A global base of 1,100 accounts with no systematic way to flag at-risk customers before they were already churning.</p>
          <div class="field-label">Role</div>
          <p class="field-text">Led a 3-person team to build 9 health monitoring tools, including a prediction model that retained $15M+ ARR through early intervention.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-image">
          <svg class="motif" viewBox="0 0 400 220" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="200" cy="110" r="20" fill="none" stroke="#1A3A6B" stroke-width="2.5" opacity="0.55"/>
            <circle cx="200" cy="110" r="46" fill="none" stroke="#1A3A6B" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.32"/>
            <circle cx="200" cy="110" r="74" fill="none" stroke="#1A3A6B" stroke-width="1.75" opacity="0.20"/>
            <circle cx="200" cy="110" r="102" fill="none" stroke="#1A3A6B" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.12"/>
            <circle cx="200" cy="110" r="6" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.6"/>
            <circle cx="246" cy="110" r="4" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.45"/>
            <circle cx="272" cy="72"  r="4" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.35"/>
            <circle cx="153" cy="139" r="4" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.35"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="impact-label">Business Impact</div>
          <div class="impact">120%+ NRR</div>
          <div class="card-rule"></div>
          <div class="field-label">Context</div>
          <p class="field-text">Six strategic enterprise accounts across Financial Services, Life Sciences, and Supply Chain, each needing a distinct engagement model.</p>
          <div class="field-label">Role</div>
          <p class="field-text">Built a high-touch success model driving EBRs, adoption, and success planning that expanded usage by 2,000+ users and $1M+ in services.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-image">
          <svg class="motif" viewBox="0 0 400 220" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
            <line x1="140" y1="80"  x2="200" y2="110" stroke="#1A3A6B" stroke-width="1.75" opacity="0.3"/>
            <line x1="140" y1="140" x2="200" y2="110" stroke="#1A3A6B" stroke-width="1.75" opacity="0.3"/>
            <line x1="200" y1="110" x2="270" y2="70"  stroke="#1A3A6B" stroke-width="1.75" opacity="0.3"/>
            <line x1="200" y1="110" x2="270" y2="150" stroke="#1A3A6B" stroke-width="1.75" opacity="0.3"/>
            <rect x="182" y="92" width="36" height="36" rx="7" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.28"/>
            <circle cx="140" cy="80" r="9" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.5"/>
            <circle cx="140" cy="140" r="9" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.5"/>
            <circle cx="270" cy="70" r="9" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.5"/>
            <circle cx="270" cy="150" r="9" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.5"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="impact-label">Business Impact</div>
          <div class="impact">~$180K Annual Spend Eliminated</div>
          <div class="card-rule"></div>
          <div class="field-label">Context</div>
          <p class="field-text">The CS team relied on Smartsheet, a third-party project management tool used by 1,000+ internal users, with no internal alternative in place.</p>
          <div class="field-label">Role</div>
          <p class="field-text">Built an AI-assisted replacement with Claude Code on Cloudflare's own infrastructure, hardened it with an engineer, and handed it to IT, eliminating ~$180K in annual spend.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-image">
          <svg class="motif" viewBox="0 0 400 220" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="96"  y="66"  width="150" height="16" rx="8" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.30"/>
            <rect x="96"  y="102" width="208" height="16" rx="8" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.20"/>
            <rect x="96"  y="138" width="120" height="16" rx="8" fill="#1A3A6B" opacity="0.14"/>
            <circle cx="286" cy="74" r="18" fill="none" stroke="#1A3A6B" stroke-width="2.5" opacity="0.55"/>
            <path d="M278 74 l6 6 l10 -12" fill="none" stroke="#1A3A6B" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" opacity="0.7"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="impact-label">Business Impact</div>
          <div class="impact">25% Faster Implementations</div>
          <div class="card-rule"></div>
          <div class="field-label">Context</div>
          <p class="field-text">70+ enterprise hospital implementations with no standardized training - onboarding time was inconsistent and bottlenecked on the CS team.</p>
          <div class="field-label">Role</div>
          <p class="field-text">Built a scalable certification program using Articulate that trained and certified 5,000+ system users, cutting onsite implementation time by a quarter.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</Layout>

<style>
  :global(main) {
    max-width: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .mw-hero {
    padding: 5.5rem 3rem 3rem;
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .mw-hero-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-ubuntu);
    font-size: 52px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .mw-hero-headline em {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .mw-sep {
    font-style: normal;
    margin: 0 0.45rem;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  .mw-intro {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem 3rem 4rem;
  }

  .mw-intro p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .mw-intro p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .mw-intro em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  /* The Work */
  .work-section {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem 5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(28, 28, 26, 0.1);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .work-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-ubuntu);
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .work-headline em {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .work-bio {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text);
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin: 0 0 2.75rem;
  }

  .cards-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .card {
    background: #fff;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.05), 0 0 0 1px rgba(26,58,107,0.06);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Featured card: image left, body right */
  .card-featured {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 42% 1fr;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .card-image {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26,58,107,0.05) 0%, rgba(26,58,107,0.12) 100%);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .card-featured .card-image {
    aspect-ratio: auto;
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 220px;
  }

  .motif {
    width: 78%;
    height: 78%;
  }

  .card-body {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .impact-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    opacity: 0.5;
    margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
  }

  .impact {
    font-family: var(--font-ubuntu);
    font-size: 1.4375rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--color-text);
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .card-featured .impact {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
  }

  .card-rule {
    width: 32px;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    opacity: 0.3;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .field-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text);
    opacity: 0.4;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    margin-top: 0.875rem;
  }

  .field-label:first-of-type {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .field-text {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .mw-hero { padding: 4rem 1.5rem 2rem; }
    .mw-hero-headline { font-size: 2rem; }
    .mw-intro { padding: 1rem 1.5rem 3rem; }
    .work-headline { font-size: 2rem; }
    .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .card-featured { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .card-featured .card-image { aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; min-height: 0; }
  }
</style>
